&lt;h2&gt;Reconnect split panes and set agent download limits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reconnecting a split SFTP pane keeps the tab, and agent download limits are now settings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reconnect keeps the tab&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reconnecting a split remote pane no longer hides the tab or its files.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent download limits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Set the largest file and the number of staged files per bookmark in Settings → Agents.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SSH inspection first&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The agent skill now has agents inspect files over SSH before downloading them.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.14"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
